        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Maze Wars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to survive the depths of the labyrinth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner, every step hides a deadly surprise. The Maze Wars throws you into the heart of a tension-filled battle that will test your mind and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter offers a completely different maze design, enemy type, and weapon mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your strategy, develop new tactics, and find your way out of the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tEach Chapter: Consists of 15 levels — learn how to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tTotal of 7 Chapters (90 Levels): Each one challenges you with unique enemies, new weapons, and evolving playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tChapter 7 – Final Boss: The last 10-level battle! There’s no escape — only victory or death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the dark atmosphere of The Maze Wars now with the demo — and prepare yourself for the real war.</p>",
